{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:84915e5d3a5e2a03","name":"Vibroknucklers","source":{"id":"source:reference-84915e5d3a5e2a03","title":"Vibroknucklers","revision":20090,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:11:14Z","sha256":"1f7837a795bb44014a5e1ef628e2244c32a0b06974342a5f2e29973c19e77f83","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20090","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Vibroknucklers&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-84915e5d3a5e2a03","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Little more than a casing attached to a set of finger rings, Vibroknucklers are a tiny weapon favored by thugs and petty thieves, mainly because the Weapon can be easily concealed or stored away. The weapon's nasty surprise- a small microblade that extends slightly beyond the knuckles- is an added bonus. Like ",{"tag":"a","children":["Combat Gloves"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Combat_Gloves","referenceId":"reference:2bd4897a780f381e"},", Vibroknucklers are two sizes smaller than their wearer (for example, Vibroknucklers designed for a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," are Tiny). Because of how they are worn, Vibroknucklers can't be ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disarmed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disarmed"}," or dropped. Additionally, while wearing Vibroknucklers, your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attacks","referenceId":"reference:e789d7addc29da1c"}," are considered to be both a normal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attack"}," (treated as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Simple Weapon (Melee)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Simple_Weapon_(Melee)"},") as well as an attack with an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Advanced Melee Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Advanced_Melee_Weapon"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Vibroknucklers require an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy Cell"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy_Cell","referenceId":"reference:a3dedb9c17e4ee9d"}," to operate, which is stored within the casing.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Small Vibroknucklers"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Advanced Melee Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Advanced_Melee_Weapons","referenceId":"reference:ffc93dd82af566f8"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Diminutive\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 200\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," +3 to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attacks","referenceId":"reference:e789d7addc29da1c"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 0.5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Slashing\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Medium Vibroknucklers"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Advanced Melee Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Advanced_Melee_Weapons","referenceId":"reference:ffc93dd82af566f8"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Tiny\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 200\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," +3 to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attacks","referenceId":"reference:e789d7addc29da1